<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>国内盆底康复企业研究与对比 | Pelvic Health Company Landscape</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F6F7F9;
  --text-main:#172033;
  --text-secondary:#667085;
  --card-bg:#FFFFFF;
  --divider:#E8EAF0;
  --medlander:#6576E8;
  --vishee:#18A6A0;
  --shiguang:#D86F9B;
  --conclusion:#8067D9;
  --risk:#E59A38;
  --radius:16px;
  --radius-sm:10px;
  --shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(23,32,51,.04),0 8px 24px rgba(23,32,51,.05);
  --shadow-hover:0 4px 12px rgba(23,32,51,.06),0 12px 40px rgba(23,32,51,.08);
  --nav-h:56px;
  --max-w:1200px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + 16px)}
body{
  font-family:'Inter','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text-main);
  line-height:1.65;
  font-size:15px;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%}

/* ===== NAV ===== */
.nav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:var(--nav-h);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
  backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(20px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--divider);
  z-index:1000;
  display:flex;align-items:center;
}
.nav-inner{
  width:100%;max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;
  padding:0 20px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;
}
.nav-brand{
  font-weight:700;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;
  color:var(--text-main);letter-spacing:-.02em;
}
.nav-brand span{color:var(--conclusion)}
.nav-links{
  display:flex;gap:2px;overflow-x:auto;flex:1;
  scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;
}
.nav-links::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.nav-links a{
  font-size:12.5px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--text-secondary);white-space:nowrap;
  transition:all .2s ease;font-weight:500;
}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text-main);background:rgba(23,32,51,.04)}
.nav-links a.active{
  color:var(--conclusion);background:rgba(128,103,217,.08);
}

/* ===== LAYOUT ===== */
.section{
  max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;
  padding:56px 20px 24px;
}
.section-head{
  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;
  margin-bottom:28px;
}
.section-num{
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--conclusion);
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  opacity:.7;
}
.section-title{
  font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;
  color:var(--text-main);
}
.section-sub{
  font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-left:auto;
}

/* ===== HERO ===== */
.hero{
  min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  justify-content:center;padding:calc(var(--nav-h) + 40px) 20px 48px;
  max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;
}
.hero-eyebrow{
  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--conclusion);
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.15;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
.hero-sub-en{
  font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);color:var(--text-secondary);
  font-weight:400;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:-.01em;
}
.hero-meta{
  font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  margin-bottom:32px;
}
.hero-judgment{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:24px 28px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  margin-bottom:32px;
  border-left:4px solid var(--conclusion);
}
.hero-judgment p{
  font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-main);
}

/* Company summary cards */
.summary-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:16px;
}
.summary-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  transition:box-shadow .25s ease,transform .25s ease;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.summary-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.summary-card .co-name{
  font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;
}
.summary-card .co-tagline{
  font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.5;
}
.summary-card .co-tags{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:auto;
}
.tag{
  font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;
  background:#F0F2F5;color:var(--text-secondary);
  font-weight:500;
}
.tag-ml{background:rgba(101,118,232,.10);color:var(--medlander)}
.tag-vs{background:rgba(24,166,160,.10);color:var(--vishee)}
.tag-sg{background:rgba(216,111,155,.10);color:var(--shiguang)}

/* ===== POSITIONING ===== */
.positioning-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
}
.pos-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  position:relative;
}
.pos-card::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;
  border-radius:var(--radius) var(--radius) 0 0;
}
.pos-ml::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.pos-vs::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.pos-sg::before{background:var(--shiguang)}
.pos-card h3{
  font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;
}
.pos-ml h3{color:var(--medlander)}
.pos-vs h3{color:var(--vishee)}
.pos-sg h3{color:var(--shiguang)}
.pos-card p{
  font-size:14px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.65;
}

/* ===== TABLE ===== */
.table-wrap{
  overflow-x:auto;
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  background:var(--card-bg);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
}
table{
  width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;
  min-width:680px;
}
thead th{
  text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;
  font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);
  border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--divider);
  white-space:nowrap;background:#FAFBFC;
}
thead th:first-child{color:var(--text-main)}
tbody td{
  padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--divider);
  vertical-align:top;
}
tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
tbody td:first-child{
  font-weight:600;color:var(--text-main);
  background:#FAFBFC;
}
.co-ml{color:var(--medlander)!important;font-weight:600!important}
.co-vs{color:var(--vishee)!important;font-weight:600!important}
.co-sg{color:var(--shiguang)!important;font-weight:600!important}

/* ===== BAR CHARTS ===== */
.chart-block{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.chart-title{
  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px;
  color:var(--text-main);
}
.bar-row{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.bar-label{
  width:90px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;
}
.bar-track{
  flex:1;height:32px;background:#F0F2F5;
  border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
}
.bar-fill{
  height:100%;border-radius:8px;
  transition:width 1s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;
  padding-right:12px;
}
.bar-fill .bar-val{
  font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.bar-fill.ml{background:var(--medlander)}
.bar-fill.vs{background:var(--vishee)}
.bar-fill.sg{
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#E8E0E6,#E8E0E6 6px,#F0EBEF 6px,#F0EBEF 12px);
}
.bar-fill.sg .bar-val{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:11.5px}
.bar-na{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12px}

.chart-grid-2col{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;
}
.chart-conclusion{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,103,217,.04),rgba(128,103,217,.01));
  border:1px solid rgba(128,103,217,.12);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:20px 24px;
  margin-top:16px;
}
.chart-conclusion p{
  font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-main);line-height:1.7;
}
.chart-conclusion p::before{
  content:'结论';display:inline-block;
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--conclusion);
  background:rgba(128,103,217,.10);padding:2px 8px;
  border-radius:6px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:1px;
}

/* ===== STAGES ===== */
.stages-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
  align-items:end;
}
.stage-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 24px 24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  position:relative;
}
.stage-card .stage-step{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;
}
.stage-vs .stage-step{color:var(--vishee)}
.stage-ml .stage-step{color:var(--medlander)}
.stage-sg .stage-step{color:var(--shiguang)}
.stage-card h3{
  font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.stage-vs h3{color:var(--vishee)}
.stage-ml h3{color:var(--medlander)}
.stage-sg h3{color:var(--shiguang)}
.stage-card ul{
  list-style:none;padding:0;
}
.stage-card li{
  font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  padding:5px 0;padding-left:16px;position:relative;
  line-height:1.55;
}
.stage-card li::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:11px;
  width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;
}
.stage-vs li::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.stage-ml li::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.stage-sg li::before{background:var(--shiguang)}
.stages-conclusion{
  margin-top:24px;
}
.stages-conclusion p{
  font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-main);line-height:1.7;
}

/* ===== COMPANY PROFILE (Collapsible) ===== */
.profile{
  margin-bottom:24px;
}
.profile-header{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius) var(--radius) 0 0;
  border-bottom:none;
  padding:24px 28px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  cursor:pointer;user-select:none;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  transition:background .2s ease;
}
.profile-header:hover{background:#FAFBFC}
.profile-header .ph-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.profile-header .ph-badge{
  width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0;
}
.ph-ml .ph-badge{background:var(--medlander)}
.ph-vs .ph-badge{background:var(--vishee)}
.ph-sg .ph-badge{background:var(--shiguang)}
.profile-header h2{
  font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;
}
.ph-ml h2{color:var(--medlander)}
.ph-vs h2{color:var(--vishee)}
.ph-sg h2{color:var(--shiguang)}
.profile-header .ph-sub{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:2px;
}
.toggle-icon{
  width:28px;height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;border-radius:8px;
  background:#F0F2F5;font-size:14px;
  transition:transform .3s ease,background .2s ease;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.profile.collapsed .toggle-icon{transform:rotate(-90deg)}
.profile-body{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  overflow:hidden;
  transition:max-height .4s ease,opacity .3s ease;
  max-height:12000px;opacity:1;
}
.profile.collapsed .profile-body{
  max-height:0;opacity:0;
}
.profile-content{padding:28px}

/* Sub-section within profile */
.sub-section{margin-bottom:32px}
.sub-section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.sub-title{
  font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.sub-title::before{
  content:'';width:3px;height:14px;border-radius:2px;
}
.ss-ml .sub-title::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .sub-title::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .sub-title::before{background:var(--shiguang)}
.sub-body{
  font-size:14px;color:var(--text-main);line-height:1.75;
}
.sub-body p{margin-bottom:10px}
.sub-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

/* One-liner positioning */
.one-liner{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,103,217,.03),rgba(128,103,217,.01));
  border:1px solid rgba(128,103,217,.10);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px;
}
.one-liner p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-main);line-height:1.7}

/* Timeline */
.timeline{position:relative;padding-left:28px}
.timeline::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:7px;top:4px;bottom:4px;
  width:2px;background:var(--divider);
}
.tl-item{position:relative;margin-bottom:20px}
.tl-item:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.tl-dot{
  position:absolute;left:-28px;top:5px;
  width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--card-bg);border:3px solid;
}
.ss-ml .tl-dot{border-color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .tl-dot{border-color:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .tl-dot{border-color:var(--shiguang)}
.tl-year{
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;
}
.ss-ml .tl-year{color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .tl-year{color:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .tl-year{color:var(--shiguang)}
.tl-text{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6}

/* Product matrix */
.prod-group{margin-bottom:20px}
.prod-group:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.prod-group-title{
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-main);
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.prod-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.prod-tag{
  font-size:12px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:8px;
  background:#F5F6F8;color:var(--text-secondary);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
}

/* Data cards */
.data-cards{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}
.data-card{
  background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:16px 18px;
}
.data-card .dc-label{
  font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:6px;
}
.data-card .dc-value{
  font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;
}
.ss-ml .data-card .dc-value{color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .data-card .dc-value{color:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .data-card .dc-value{color:var(--shiguang)}

/* Number cards (R&D) */
.num-cards{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(140px,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}
.num-card{
  background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:18px;text-align:center;
}
.num-card .nc-value{
  font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.ss-ml .num-card .nc-value{color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .num-card .nc-value{color:var(--vishee)}
.num-card .nc-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)}

/* Proportion bars */
.prop-bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.prop-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.prop-label{
  width:110px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;
  text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;
}
.prop-track{
  flex:1;height:24px;background:#F0F2F5;
  border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;
}
.prop-fill{
  height:100%;border-radius:6px;
  transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
}
.prop-val{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;width:60px;flex-shrink:0}
.ss-ml .prop-fill{background:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .prop-fill{background:var(--vishee)}

/* Feature cards (Shiguang) */
.feature-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;
}
.feature-card{
  background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:18px;
}
.feature-card h4{
  font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;
  color:var(--shiguang);
}
.feature-card p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.55}

/* Highlight note */
.note-box{
  background:rgba(229,154,56,.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(229,154,56,.18);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  padding:14px 18px;margin-top:16px;
}
.note-box p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-main);line-height:1.65}

/* Advantages/Risks lists */
.ad-list{
  list-style:none;padding:0;
}
.ad-list li{
  font-size:13.5px;padding:6px 0 6px 18px;
  position:relative;line-height:1.6;
}
.ad-list.adv li::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:11px;
  width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--vishee);
}
.ad-list.risk li::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:11px;
  width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--risk);
}
.ss-ml .ad-list.adv li::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .ad-list.adv li::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .ad-list.adv li::before{background:var(--shiguang)}

/* Future plan path */
.plan-path{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.plan-step{
  font-size:12.5px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;
  background:#F5F6F8;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main);
}
.ss-ml .plan-step{border-color:rgba(101,118,232,.25);color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .plan-step{border-color:rgba(24,166,160,.25);color:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .plan-step{border-color:rgba(216,111,155,.25);color:var(--shiguang)}
.plan-arrow{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12px}
.plan-keywords{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;
}
.kw{
  font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:16px;
  font-weight:500;
}
.ss-ml .kw{background:rgba(101,118,232,.08);color:var(--medlander)}
.ss-vs .kw{background:rgba(24,166,160,.08);color:var(--vishee)}
.ss-sg .kw{background:rgba(216,111,155,.08);color:var(--shiguang)}

/* ===== CAPABILITY MATRIX ===== */
.matrix-wrap{
  overflow-x:auto;
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  background:var(--card-bg);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
}
.matrix-table{min-width:680px}
.matrix-table thead th{
  text-align:center;padding:16px 12px;
}
.matrix-table thead th:first-child{text-align:left}
.matrix-table tbody td{
  text-align:center;padding:10px 12px;
}
.matrix-table tbody td:first-child{
  text-align:left;font-size:13px;
}
.badge{
  display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;
  padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;min-width:50px;
}
.b-strong{background:rgba(24,166,160,.12);color:#0d7d77}
.b-good{background:rgba(101,118,232,.10);color:#4a5bd4}
.b-mid{background:#F0F2F5;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.b-start{background:rgba(229,154,56,.10);color:#b87a1e}
.b-na{background:#F0F2F5;color:#a0a8b5}
.b-weak{background:rgba(229,154,56,.10);color:#b87a1e}
.b-prod{background:rgba(216,111,155,.10);color:#b85a82}
.b-verify{background:rgba(229,154,56,.10);color:#b87a1e}
.b-high{background:rgba(24,166,160,.12);color:#0d7d77}
.b-low{background:rgba(229,154,56,.10);color:#b87a1e}
.b-mature{background:rgba(101,118,232,.10);color:#4a5bd4}
.b-early{background:rgba(229,154,56,.10);color:#b87a1e}

.matrix-conclusion{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
  margin-top:20px;
}
.mc-card{
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:16px 20px;
  border:1px solid;
}
.mc-ml{border-color:rgba(101,118,232,.20);background:rgba(101,118,232,.03)}
.mc-vs{border-color:rgba(24,166,160,.20);background:rgba(24,166,160,.03)}
.mc-sg{border-color:rgba(216,111,155,.20);background:rgba(216,111,155,.03)}
.mc-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.mc-ml p strong{color:var(--medlander)}
.mc-vs p strong{color:var(--vishee)}
.mc-sg p strong{color:var(--shiguang)}

/* ===== BUSINESS MODEL ===== */
.bm-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
}
.bm-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  position:relative;
}
.bm-card::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;
  border-radius:var(--radius) var(--radius) 0 0;
}
.bm-ml::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.bm-vs::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.bm-sg::before{background:var(--shiguang)}
.bm-card h3{
  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;
}
.bm-ml h3{color:var(--medlander)}
.bm-vs h3{color:var(--vishee)}
.bm-sg h3{color:var(--shiguang)}
.bm-card .bm-desc{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;
}
.bm-flow{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.bm-flow-item{
  font-size:12.5px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;
  background:#F5F6F8;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  text-align:center;font-weight:500;
}
.bm-plus{
  text-align:center;color:var(--text-secondary);
  font-size:11px;line-height:1;
}
.bm-card ul{list-style:none;padding:0}
.bm-card li{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  padding:4px 0 4px 14px;position:relative;line-height:1.5;
}
.bm-card li::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;
  width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;
}
.bm-ml li::before{background:var(--medlander)}
.bm-vs li::before{background:var(--vishee)}
.bm-sg li::before{background:var(--shiguang)}

/* ===== PROS/CONS ===== */
.pc-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
}
.pc-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.pc-card h3{
  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px;
  padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--divider);
}
.pc-ml h3{color:var(--medlander)}
.pc-vs h3{color:var(--vishee)}
.pc-sg h3{color:var(--shiguang)}
.pc-section{margin-bottom:14px}
.pc-section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.pc-label{
  font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
}
.pc-label.adv{color:#0d7d77}
.pc-label.risk{color:var(--risk)}
.pc-label-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.pc-label.adv .pc-label-dot{background:var(--vishee)}
.pc-label.risk .pc-label-dot{background:var(--risk)}
.pc-ml .pc-label.adv .pc-label-dot{background:var(--medlander)}
.pc-sg .pc-label.adv .pc-label-dot{background:var(--shiguang)}
.pc-card ul{list-style:none;padding:0}
.pc-card li{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  padding:4px 0 4px 14px;position:relative;line-height:1.5;
}
.pc-card li::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;
  width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--divider);
}

/* ===== FUTURE PLANS ===== */
.fp-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;
}
.fp-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 24px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.fp-card h3{
  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.fp-ml h3{color:var(--medlander)}
.fp-vs h3{color:var(--vishee)}
.fp-sg h3{color:var(--shiguang)}

/* ===== CONCLUSION ===== */
.conclusion-block{
  max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;
  padding:56px 20px 48px;
}
.conc-main{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,103,217,.06),rgba(128,103,217,.02));
  border:1px solid rgba(128,103,217,.15);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:36px 36px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.conc-main p{
  font-size:clamp(17px,2.5vw,21px);font-weight:600;
  line-height:1.55;color:var(--text-main);
  letter-spacing:-.01em;
}
.conc-full{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 32px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.conc-full p{
  font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-main);
}
.conc-second{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:28px 32px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  border-left:4px solid var(--conclusion);
}
.conc-second p{
  font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-main);
}
.conc-label{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--conclusion);
  margin-bottom:10px;display:block;
}

/* ===== SOURCES ===== */
.sources-list{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}
.source-card{
  background:var(--card-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  padding:14px 18px;
  transition:border-color .2s ease;
}
.source-card:hover{border-color:rgba(128,103,217,.25)}
.source-card .src-num{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--conclusion);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.source-card .src-title{
  font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;
  color:var(--text-main);
}
.source-card .src-link{
  font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  word-break:break-all;
  display:block;
}
.source-card .src-link:hover{color:var(--conclusion)}
.sources-disclaimer{
  margin-top:24px;
  background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--divider);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:16px 20px;
}
.sources-disclaimer p{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.65;
}

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
.footer{
  max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;
  padding:32px 20px 48px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--divider);
}
.footer p{
  font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);
  text-align:center;line-height:1.6;
}

/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .summary-grid,.positioning-grid,.stages-grid,
  .bm-grid,.pc-grid,.fp-grid,.matrix-conclusion,
  .chart-grid-2col{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }
  .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .section{padding:40px 16px 16px}
  .section-title{font-size:20px}
  .hero{padding:calc(var(--nav-h) + 24px) 16px 32px}
  .hero h1{font-size:30px}
  .hero-sub-en{font-size:15px}
  .hero-judgment{padding:18px 20px}
  .conc-main{padding:24px}
  .conc-full,.conc-second{padding:20px}
  .conc-main p{font-size:16px}
  .profile-content{padding:20px 16px}
  .profile-header{padding:18px 20px}
  .profile-header h2{font-size:17px}
  .data-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .num-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .nav-brand{display:none}
  .nav-inner{padding:0 12px;gap:8px}
  .nav-links{gap:0}
  .nav-links a{padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px}
}
@media(max-width:520px){
  .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .data-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .num-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .bar-label{width:70px;font-size:12px}
  .prop-label{width:90px;font-size:11.5px}
}

/* ===== PRINT ===== */
@media print{
  .nav{display:none!important}
  html{scroll-padding-top:0}
  body{background:#fff;font-size:12px}
  .section,.hero,.conclusion-block,.footer{
    max-width:100%;padding:16px 0;
    page-break-inside:avoid;
  }
  .hero{min-height:auto;padding-top:16px}
  .hero h1{font-size:28px}
  .profile.collapsed .profile-body{
    max-height:none!important;opacity:1!important;
  }
  .profile{page-break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:16px}
  .profile-body{border-radius:0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius)}
  .card,.summary-card,.pos-card,.stage-card,
  .chart-block,.bm-card,.pc-card,.fp-card,
  .source-card,.conc-main,.conc-full,.conc-second{
    page-break-inside:avoid;box-shadow:none;
  }
  .table-wrap,.matrix-wrap{
    page-break-inside:avoid;overflow:visible;
  }
  table,.matrix-table{min-width:auto;width:100%}
  .toggle-icon{display:none}
  .summary-grid,.positioning-grid,.stages-grid,
  .bm-grid,.pc-grid,.fp-grid,.matrix-conclusion,
  .chart-grid-2col{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .sources-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .bar-fill,.prop-fill{transition:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== NAVIGATION ===== -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="nav-brand">盆底康复企业研究 <span>·</span> 对比看板</div>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#hero" class="active">核心结论</a>
      <a href="#positioning">公司定位</a>
      <a href="#core-metrics">指标对比</a>
      <a href="#stages">发展阶段</a>
      <a href="#medlander">麦澜德</a>
      <a href="#vishee">伟思医疗</a>
      <a href="#shiguang">拾光医疗</a>
      <a href="#capability-matrix">能力矩阵</a>
      <a href="#business-model">商业模式</a>
      <a href="#pros-cons">优劣势</a>
      <a href="#future-plans">未来规划</a>
      <a href="#conclusion">综合结论</a>
      <a href="#sources">资料来源</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ===== 1. HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">PELVIC HEALTH COMPANY LANDSCAPE</div>
  <h1>国内盆底康复企业研究与对比</h1>
  <div class="hero-sub-en">Pelvic Health Company Landscape</div>
  <div class="hero-meta">研究对象：麦澜德 × 伟思医疗 × 拾光医疗 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 公开资料更新至2026年8月</div>

  <div class="hero-judgment">
    <p>三家公司虽然都进入盆底康复与女性健康领域，但代表了三种不同的企业形态：伟思医疗代表底层技术与综合康复平台，麦澜德代表女性健康临床产业化体系，拾光医疗代表家用产品与女性消费体验。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="summary-grid">
    <!-- 麦澜德 -->
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="co-name" style="color:var(--medlander)">麦澜德</div>
      <div class="co-tagline">女性健康与盆底康复专业化平台</div>
      <div class="co-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-ml">科创板上市</span>
        <span class="tag tag-ml">女性健康</span>
        <span class="tag tag-ml">盆底与妇产康复</span>
        <span class="tag tag-ml">医院整体解决方案</span>
        <span class="tag tag-ml">设备与耗材闭环</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 伟思医疗 -->
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="co-name" style="color:var(--vishee)">伟思医疗</div>
      <div class="co-tagline">以磁刺激和电生理为核心的综合康复平台</div>
      <div class="co-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-vs">科创板上市</span>
        <span class="tag tag-vs">磁刺激</span>
        <span class="tag tag-vs">电生理</span>
        <span class="tag tag-vs">综合康复</span>
        <span class="tag tag-vs">多科室技术平台</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 拾光医疗 -->
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="co-name" style="color:var(--shiguang)">拾光医疗</div>
      <div class="co-tagline">围绕家用盆底治疗仪打造的消费医疗新品牌</div>
      <div class="co-tags">
        <span class="tag tag-sg">创业公司</span>
        <span class="tag tag-sg">家用医疗</span>
        <span class="tag tag-sg">女性用户体验</span>
        <span class="tag tag-sg">App服务</span>
        <span class="tag tag-sg">消费化产品设计</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 2. POSITIONING ===== -->
<section class="section" id="positioning">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">02</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">三家公司一句话定位</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="positioning-grid">
    <div class="pos-card pos-ml">
      <h3>麦澜德</h3>
      <p>从盆底及产后康复切入，逐步构建"评估—诊断—治疗—耗材—数据—培训"的女性健康专科生态。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pos-card pos-vs">
      <h3>伟思医疗</h3>
      <p>从代理和市场销售起步，逐步建立磁刺激、电刺激和电生理技术平台，发展成为多科室综合康复医疗器械公司。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pos-card pos-sg">
      <h3>拾光医疗</h3>
      <p>从女性用户和产后康复体验切入，把医院式盆底治疗转化为更加私密、友好和适合家庭坚持使用的产品。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 3. CORE METRICS ===== -->
<section class="section" id="core-metrics">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">03</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">核心指标横向对比</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>维度</th>
          <th class="co-ml">麦澜德</th>
          <th class="co-vs">伟思医疗</th>
          <th class="co-sg">拾光医疗</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>公司主体</td><td>南京麦澜德医疗科技股份有限公司</td><td>南京伟思医疗科技股份有限公司</td><td>苏州拾锦医疗科技有限公司</td></tr>
        <tr><td>成立时间</td><td>2013年</td><td>2001年</td><td>2023年</td></tr>
        <tr><td>总部所在地</td><td>南京</td><td>南京</td><td>苏州</td></tr>
        <tr><td>上市情况</td><td>2022年科创板上市，688273</td><td>2020年科创板上市，688580</td><td>未上市</td></tr>
        <tr><td>创始人</td><td>杨瑞嘉、史志怀、陈彬等</td><td>王志愚</td><td>孙丹印</td></tr>
        <tr><td>当前负责人</td><td>杨瑞嘉，董事长兼总经理</td><td>王志愚，董事长兼总经理</td><td>孙丹印，创始人兼CEO</td></tr>
        <tr><td>核心定位</td><td>盆底、妇产、生殖康复及女性抗衰</td><td>综合康复、磁刺激、电生理及神经调控</td><td>女性家用智能医疗消费品</td></tr>
        <tr><td>主要客户</td><td>医院妇产科、盆底中心、产后康复及医美机构</td><td>医院康复科、精神科、神经科、妇产科及儿童康复机构</td><td>家庭女性用户、院外机构及代理渠道</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2025年营收</td><td>4.32亿元</td><td>4.63亿元</td><td>未公开</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2025年归母净利润</td><td>1.03亿元</td><td>1.38亿元</td><td>未公开</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2025年研发投入率</td><td>15.31%</td><td>12.63%</td><td>未公开</td></tr>
        <tr><td>最突出能力</td><td>女性健康专科方案、医院覆盖、耗材和数据闭环</td><td>磁刺激、电生理、技术平台广度和盈利能力</td><td>产品设计、隐私体验、App和家庭服务</td></tr>
        <tr><td>国际化现状</td><td>海外收入占比不足1%</td><td>海外收入占比不足1%</td><td>暂无公开海外销售规模</td></tr>
        <tr><td>当前发展阶段</td><td>成熟专科平台</td><td>成熟综合平台</td><td>早期家用医疗品牌</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- Charts -->
  <div style="margin-top:24px">
    <div class="chart-grid-2col">
      <!-- Revenue & Profit -->
      <div class="chart-block">
        <div class="chart-title">2025年经营规模</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:12px">营业收入</div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--vishee)">伟思医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill vs" style="width:93.5%"><span class="bar-val">4.63亿元</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--medlander)">麦澜德</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill ml" style="width:87.2%"><span class="bar-val">4.32亿元</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--shiguang)">拾光医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill sg" style="width:100%"><span class="bar-val">未公开</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:20px 0 12px">归母净利润</div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--vishee)">伟思医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill vs" style="width:100%"><span class="bar-val">1.38亿元</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--medlander)">麦澜德</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill ml" style="width:74.6%"><span class="bar-val">1.03亿元</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--shiguang)">拾光医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill sg" style="width:100%"><span class="bar-val">未公开</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- R&D Rate -->
      <div class="chart-block">
        <div class="chart-title">研发投入率</div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--medlander)">麦澜德</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill ml" style="width:100%"><span class="bar-val">15.31%</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--vishee)">伟思医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill vs" style="width:82.5%"><span class="bar-val">12.63%</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row">
          <div class="bar-label" style="color:var(--shiguang)">拾光医疗</div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill sg" style="width:100%"><span class="bar-val">未公开</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:24px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7">
          <p style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong style="color:var(--medlander)">麦澜德</strong>研发投入约6607万元，研发人员约150人。</p>
          <p><strong style="color:var(--vishee)">伟思医疗</strong>研发投入约5846万元，研发人员约137人。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-conclusion">
      <p>2025年伟思医疗的收入、利润增速和盈利水平高于麦澜德；麦澜德的女性健康聚焦度、盆底专科生态和研发投入率更高。拾光医疗尚处于单品商业化早期，不能直接按营收规模与两家上市公司比较。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 4. STAGES ===== -->
<section class="section" id="stages">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">04</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">三家公司发展阶段</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="stages-grid">
    <div class="stage-card stage-vs" style="margin-top:0">
      <div class="stage-step">STAGE 1 — 最早期</div>
      <h3>伟思医疗：成熟综合康复平台</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>成立时间最早</li>
        <li>技术平台最宽</li>
        <li>产品覆盖科室最多</li>
        <li>磁刺激和电生理标签突出</li>
        <li>综合康复属性强</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-card stage-ml" style="margin-top:24px">
      <div class="stage-step">STAGE 2 — 专科聚焦</div>
      <h3>麦澜德：成熟女性健康专科平台</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>深耕盆底与妇产康复</li>
        <li>女性健康定位最集中</li>
        <li>医院科室解决方案完整</li>
        <li>设备、耗材、数据和服务闭环</li>
        <li>正向女性抗衰和脑机接口扩张</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-card stage-sg" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div class="stage-step">STAGE 3 — 早期</div>
      <h3>拾光医疗：早期家用医疗品牌</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>从家庭女性用户切入</li>
        <li>产品设计和隐私体验突出</li>
        <li>目前以单一核心产品为主</li>
        <li>App与健康服务结合</li>
        <li>规模、渠道和产品矩阵仍待验证</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-conclusion stages-conclusion">
    <p>行业地位不能只按营收判断。伟思医疗强在底层技术和综合平台，麦澜德强在女性健康专科生态，拾光医疗强在家用产品体验和消费化表达。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 5. 麦澜德 PROFILE ===== -->
<section class="section" id="medlander">
